      "name": "Russell",
      "created_at": "2026-02-24T16:15:48.772Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am looking for some guidance on how to create different desk (workspace) layouts, which we can link to a role or role profile. We can edit the workspace for a module, but need the layouts to be role driven.</p>\n<p>This is for ease of maintenance and to create a clean UI for each role.</p>\n<p>Any guidance would be appreciated.</p>",
